# Allowlist: the build context is only the Go module and its non-test sources. Everything else
# (.git, test/, docs/, deploy/, scripts/, .superpowers/, .env files, kubeconfigs, keys, bin/, dist/,
# editor and OS files) never reaches the builder.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
# and inside the allowed directories: no tests, fixtures or anything secret-like
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/.env*
**/*kubeconfig*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
